<https://beatscript.app/ontology/concept/grammar-headed> a <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#Concept>, <https://beatscript.app/ontology/ns#GrammarProduction> ;
    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "headed"@en ;
    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "The headed production of BeatScript's grammar (a deck's parts: no time word before them; the control deck; a def's call, a duck and a mix name their decks themselves)."@en ;
