    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "The part production of BeatScript's grammar (hihat/12 x x ~ x : a cycle of 12 sixteenths; bass seed(techno, 42)[17..24]: a generated part's bars; bass <cid>.drop: a stored program's)."@en ;
