<https://beatscript.app/ontology/concept/grammar-emit> a <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#Concept>, <https://beatscript.app/ontology/ns#GrammarProduction> ;
    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "emit"@en ;
    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "The emit production of BeatScript's grammar (a line of a def body: what an out port carries)."@en ;
